oll showed the race tied, but its small sample and age limit its weight. The evidence points to a Republican favorite with some room for movement.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.257, "margin": -3.74}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.2349, "margin": -5.0}]}